{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"529f9351-26a8-4f40-9e49-0a138c5dda71","step_index":19,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":0.065150083,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"git grep -n \"invariants\" package.json audit/"},"output":"Created At: 2026-11-22T23:34:56+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-22T23:34:56+05:30\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\naudit/99-final-report.md:20:While the project features a cleanly scaffolded architecture (React 19, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 4, Express 5, Better Auth, Prisma 7, and Dexie offline storage), **it was vibe coded without strict concurrency controls, rigorous input validation, or complete workflow enforcement**. Critical business invariants specified in the requirements are broken or missing.\r\naudit/99-final-report.md:115:- **EXPECTED**: Double-entry ledger invariants, append-only stock movements, gapless FY invoice numbering, atomic moving weighted average valuation, Mod-36 GSTIN checksum validation.\r\naudit/99-final-report.md:388:MillLedger is a promising foundation with a modern web stack, but it was rushed into existence without the rigorous transactional invariants, security gates, and complete user interfaces required for mission-critical enterprise manufacturing software. \r\naudit/coverage.md:181:11. `/audit/scripts/verify-payments.ts` (Tested underpayment, overpayment, auto-FIFO allocation across 3 invoices, cash credit, invariants)\r\naudit/coverage.md:184:14. `/audit/scripts/invariants.sql` (10 domain invariant SQL checks; 0 violating rows observed)\r\naudit/findings/F-017.md:45:The API accepts arbitrary `OrderStatus` enum values from the client payload during order creation. A salesman can directly create orders with `status: \"APPROVED\"`, completely bypassing manager authorization, ATP stock checks, credit limit checks, and stock reservation creation. The order exists in the database as `APPROVED` with 0 stock reserved, corrupting downstream fulfilment invariants.\r\naudit/findings/F-033.md:19:6. Chronological date invariants must be enforced (`dueDate \u003e= invoiceDate`, `paymentDate \u003c= current_date`).\r\naudit/findings/F-033.md:37:Zero enforcement of essential food manufacturing domain rules, statutory Indian business formats, or temporal invariants.\r\naudit/findings/F-033.md:58:`audit/tests/domain-invariants.test.ts` testing each domain constraint against both API endpoints and Prisma database models.\r\naudit/findings/F-095.md:18:  - No `as unknown as` double casts to escape type safety without documented runtime invariants.\r\naudit/phase-02-domain.md:24:| **F. Payments** | REQ-039, REQ-040, REQ-041 | `VERIFIED-PASS` (with caveats) | FIFO auto-allocation, overpayments, and mathematical invariants verified; Payment bounce/reversal flow missing (F-013) |\r\naudit/phase-02-domain.md:514:All domain ledger invariants have been codified into an executable SQL test suite:\r\naudit/phase-02-domain.md:515:**Script Path**: [`/audit/scripts/invariants.sql`](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/scripts/invariants.sql)\r\naudit/phase-02-domain.md:519:psql \"postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/mill_ledger_audit_throwaway\" -f audit/scripts/invariants.sql\r\naudit/phase-02-domain.md:521:Verified that 0 rows violate any of the 10 domain invariants.\r\naudit/phase-04-validation-logging.md:13:Phase 4 evaluated the input validation coverage, fuzzing resilience, statutory domain invariants, error handling consistency, request correlation, telemetry logging, and business audit trails across the entire MillLedger ERP platform.\r\naudit/phase-04-validation-logging.md:163:All 10 domain rules failed. Food manufacturing ERP invariants (e.g. discrete flour sacks, mill recipe yields, and credit control) are entirely bypassed.\r\naudit/scripts/invariants.sql:3:-- Execute against PostgreSQL: psql -f invariants.sql\r\naudit/scripts/verify-domain-validation.ts:253:    expectedBehavior: \"Enforce chronological invariants (dueDate \u003e= invoiceDate, paymentDate \u003c= current_date)\",\r\naudit/tracker/check-tracker.mjs:5: * Enforces the strict status state machine and integrity invariants:\r\naudit/tracker/tracker.json:62:        \"note\": \"VERIFIED in run 009: Verified by independent audit verifier across all 10 protocol checks. Clean checkout and fresh migrations pass, original repro defect eliminated across all 10 UI surfaces (0 toLocaleString and 0 toFixed remain in client/src/pages/), revert test proves regression test sensitivity, 4/4 mutants killed (0 survived), 16 adversarial probes pass, sibling sweep verified, 18/18 benchmark assertions pass, 10/10 SQL invariants hold, 123/123 tests pass, 0 typecheck/lint errors, production build clean, diff review clean, and Jakob Nielsen Heuristic #4 / WCAG 2.2 SC 3.2.4 satisfied.\"\r\naudit/tracker/tracker.json:90:    \"notes\": \"VERIFIED in verification run 009: All 10 verification protocol gates passed cleanly with raw evidence recorded under audit/evidence/verify/F-097/. Surviving mutants: 0. Benchmark 18/18 pass, invariants 10/10 pass, tests 123/123 pass.\"\r\naudit/tracker/tracker.json:173:        \"note\": \"VERIFIED in run 010: Independently verified across all 10 protocol checks. Fresh environment migrations pass from zero; original repro blocked; revert check proves regression test sensitivity (fails without fix, passes with fix); 5/5 mutants killed (0 survived); adversarial probes pass (status downgrade to DRAFT blocked, snapshot tampering blocked, 50 concurrent SQL UPDATEs blocked, valid payment transitions allowed, lines immutable on POSTED invoices); sibling sweep verified; 18/18 benchmark assertions and 10/10 SQL database invariants pass; full test suite passes; diff clean; OWASP ASVS 8.3.1, REQ-009, REQ-036, and CGST Section 130 satisfied.\"\r\naudit/tracker/tracker.json:647:        \"note\": \"VERIFIED in run 010: Independently verified across all 10 protocol checks. Fresh environment migrations pass from zero; original repro under TZ=UTC resolved (returns 2026-27); revert check proves regression test sensitivity (fails without fix under TZ=UTC, passes with fix); 3/3 mutants killed (0 survived); adversarial probes pass across 10 extreme global timezones, microsecond boundaries, leap days, and century rollovers; sibling sweep confirmed zero other FY calculations; full test suite, benchmark, and SQL invariants pass under TZ=UTC; diff clean; CGST Rule 46(b) and Income-tax Act Section 2(7) satisfied.\"\r\n"}}}
